meta {
  name: the carve-out stops at organizations
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/brands
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{orgNoScopesKey}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 403
  res.body.code: eq insufficient_scope
  res.body.message: contains brands:read
}

docs {
  These assertions are coupled to the single-org key model: a key is bound to
  exactly one organization by referenceId (DESIGN.md §1.2 marks that as a
  decision point). If key ownership ever moves to user + live membership, a key
  could reach several organizations and these are expected to change.
}
